  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-whale-chat 🐳",
      "text": "[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-whale-chat)\n[](https://github.com/Artificialimbecile/dsh-whale-chat/blob/main/LICENSE)\n[](https://github.com/topics/dsh-plugin)"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-whale-chat 🐳",
      "text": "> 一只会说话的透明鲸鱼桌宠，住在 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) 的 Web 界面右下角。\n> **形象与动画沿用 [`dsh-pet`](https://github.com/PC2005-cloud/dsh-pet)（二次创作）**，设置页风格参考 [`dsh-bili-whale`](https://github.com/Alterssss/dsh-bili-whale)。\n>\n> A talking whale desktop pet for DeepSeek Harness: chat with it, give it a persona, and let it wander the web on its own to bring back things worth telling you. Art & animations are a derivative work based on [`dsh-pet`](https://github.com/PC2005-cloud/dsh-pet)."
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
